        "created_at": "2013-08-24T23:23:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just to be fair I have no problem with the other SotM RPGs that may or may nbot have happened (I was super busy with other things to look in on them). My system is completely original (in as much as anything is these days) and not associated with any established system. Look for the rules and basic playtest material to be posted soon. I have a few things to tweak and get feedback for before I can commit to everyones opinion on here.</p>",
