        "created_at": "2014-04-14T23:44:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Due to some major setbacks on time, energy and lack of response from those that have had playtest copies for awhile now this project is currently shelved. If there is an interest I will pick it up again and possibly have something in time for GenCon but for now with the low interest and lack of time to spend on this project it will have to wait.</p><p>Thanks to everyone that expressed an interest and was willing to see what I had done.</p>",
